OL,3,ADivorce, smartphones and control - BBC
OL,4,Asees how Taliban run Afghanistan
OL,5,
OL,6,FGovernor Abdullah Sarhadi gives money
OL,7,Fto treat a boy's broken arm and hands
OL,8,Fout funds for a local mosque - then, in
OL,9,Fhis office in northern Afghanistan, an
OL,10,Fastonishing exchange unfolds.
OL,12,FA young woman tells the grey-bearded
OL,13,Fformer Taliban commander that she wants
OL,14,Fto divorce her husband, who she accuses
OL,15,Fof months of abuse and beatings.
OL,17,FShe will not take no for an answer.
