OL,3,ADivorce, smartphones and control - BBC
OL,4,Asees how Taliban run Afghanistan
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a country where girls are banned
OL,7,Ffrom secondary education, the
OL,8,F18-year-old argues her case calmly and
OL,9,Fconfidently, her face completely hidden
OL,10,Fbehind a full-face veil and sunglasses.
